    <string name="sms_permission_message">Cymatune can detect silent SMS events used by some towers.\n\nThis requires SMS permissions to:\n• Detect silent SMS (Class 0 messages)\n• Correlate SMS with network paging patterns\n• Identify unusual signal events\n\nYour messages are NEVER read or stored. Only metadata is analyzed for signal anomalies.\n\nThis feature is optional but recommended for comprehensive analysis.</string>
